      "writtenOn": "2026-09-28T14:16:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what about adding this service to `entity-manager` repository?\n\ni don`t believe that concerns like (\u0027it does not fit with the repo name\u0027) concerns outweigh the concrete advantages of being able to change, refactor and maintain e.g. the configuration alongside the implementation.\n\nIn the past, e.g. with `dbus-sensors` it has often been a struggle to synchronize between different repos maintainers and always needing 2 patches for the simplest changes. Let\u0027s not repeat this issue here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 448,
        "startChar": 49,
        "endLine": 460,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "65a17555a36bd3ac595318441a9f69584aec7cb9",
